# Noir build output is ignored, EXCEPT the compiled contract artifacts @nulo/bridge-core imports —
# committed so CI (which does not run nargo) can typecheck + bundle them. The .json.bak stay ignored.
*/target/*
!*/target/*.json
target/*
!target/*.json
